## Key Functional Requirements

| ID | Module | Description |
|---|---|---|
| **FR-1** | **Stage 1 Triage** | Frontend-based screening with 15 "Golden Features" and offline AI fallback. |
| **FR-2** | **Stage 2 Diagnostics** | High-precision clinical review (XGBoost/Deep Learning) for identified high-risk patients. |
| **FR-3** | **Offline Support** | Service worker caching and localStorage queuing for clinical operations in rural areas. |
| **FR-4** | **Trilingual Support** | Complete trilingual UI mapping for English, Sinhala, and Tamil across all user touchpoints. |
| **FR-5** | **Dashboards** | Role-specific interfaces for Clinical, Frontline, Admin, and Patient populations. |

## System Constraints

- **Connectivity:** Must perform 100% of triage operations without an active internet connection.
- **Privacy:** Maternal health data must be encrypted in local storage before synchronization.
- **Latency:** Critical risk alerts must be generated in < 2 seconds regardless of network state.
- **Device Support:** Optimized for medical tablets (Frontline) and mobile devices (Patient).
